SELECT t."适用工厂" AS "适用工厂",(t."供货验证状态").name AS "供货验证状态",(t."技术适配状态").name AS "技术适配状态",COUNT(t.rec_id) AS total,s."国家" AS supplier_country,(s."推广阶段").name AS supplier_stage FROM "SupplyMappings" AS t LEFT JOIN "Suppliers" AS s ON t."供应商" @> ARRAY[s.rec_id] INNER JOIN "Members" AS access_member ON (access_member."用户").id = CURRENT_USER_ID() LEFT JOIN "Roles" AS access_role ON access_member."角色编码" = access_role."角色编码" WHERE (access_member."状态").name = '启用' AND (((access_member."角色编码" IS NULL AND (access_member."角色").name IN ('管理员','采购','中央仓','技术','只读')) OR (access_role."启用" = TRUE AND access_role."权限代码" LIKE '%|dashboard.view|%')) OR ((access_member."角色编码" IS NULL AND (access_member."角色").name IN ('管理员','采购','中央仓','技术','只读')) OR (access_role."启用" = TRUE AND access_role."权限代码" LIKE '%|reports.view|%'))) GROUP BY t."适用工厂",(t."供货验证状态").name,(t."技术适配状态").name,s."国家",(s."推广阶段").name LIMIT 10000